1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,047
Yeah, it's so funny, though,
because me and Drake, you know,
いや、マジで笑えるんだけどさ
俺とDrakeがさ

2
00:00:03,067 --> 00:00:06,286
before Donda came out,
we met up at the studio.
『Donda』が出る前に
スタジオで会ったんだよ

3
00:00:06,306 --> 00:00:10,366
So then Drake says to me, yo...
で、Drakeが俺に言うわけ…

4
00:00:12,746 --> 00:00:14,756
no, I need to tell the story like this.
いや、話す順番を変えるわ

5
00:00:16,496 --> 00:00:21,706
So basically, you know,
Jared Kushner asked Steve Stoute,
要するにさ、Jared Kushnerが
Steve Stouteに聞いたんだよ

6
00:00:16,496 --> 00:00:24,836
Jared Kushner：トランプ元大統領の娘婿
Steve Stoute：音楽・広告業界の実業家

7
00:00:21,726 --> 00:00:24,836
like, yo, just tell me,
did Ye f**k my wife?
「正直に言ってくれ、Yeは
俺の妻とヤったのか？」って

8
00:00:24,856 --> 00:00:27,366
And Steve Stoute was like, no,
Steveは「いや、Yeは何もしてない」って

9
00:00:27,386 --> 00:00:29,786
Ye never did nothing.
Steveは「いや、Yeは何もしてない」って

10
00:00:29,806 --> 00:00:31,646
So when I went to the White House,
で、ホワイトハウスに行った時

11
00:00:32,036 --> 00:00:33,386
I saw Jared.
Jaredに会ったんだよ

12
00:00:33,406 --> 00:00:36,346
I was like, yo, I want to just tell
you, nothing ever happened.
俺は「一応言っとくけ
ど、何もなかったから」

13
00:00:36,366 --> 00:00:38,266
He's like, yo, I don't know
what you're talking about.
あいつは「何の話かわからない」って

14
00:00:38,286 --> 00:00:40,266
I was like, yo, and I grabbed
him by both shoulders,
で、俺はあいつの両肩をつかんで

15
00:00:40,286 --> 00:00:41,756
and I was like, yo, Jared,
「Jared、マジで何もなかったから」って

16
00:00:41,776 --> 00:00:44,486
nothing has ever happened.
「Jared、マジで何もなかったから」って

17
00:00:44,506 --> 00:00:46,886
And he said, yo, thank
you for saying that.
そしたら「言ってくれてありがとう」って

18
00:00:46,906 --> 00:00:50,346
Okay, so when I saw Drake,
we was in a parking lot,
で、Drakeに会った時

19
00:00:50,366 --> 00:00:51,806
we were talking, and he said, yo,
駐車場で話してたら、あいつが

20
00:00:51,826 --> 00:00:54,926
I just want to tell you, yo,
nothing ever happened.
「一応言っとくけど、
何もなかったから」って

21
00:00:51,826 --> 00:00:56,986
「何もなかった」：DrakeとYeの
元妻Kimの間に、という意味

22
00:00:55,406 --> 00:00:58,676
And then I said, yo,
thank you for saying that.
で、俺が「言ってくれてありがとう」って

23
00:00:58,696 --> 00:01:00,666
When did I become Jared Kushner?
いつから俺が
Jared Kushnerになったんだよ

24
00:01:04,636 --> 00:01:06,836
I didn't know where this was going.
どこに向かう話かと思ったわ

25
00:01:10,806 --> 00:01:12,706
I did not know where this was going.
マジでどうなるかと思った

26
00:01:12,726 --> 00:01:14,096
You had me scared for a second.
一瞬ビビったわ
